  "answer": "This is a known issue. The crash is a NullReferenceException in WPF's ThemeManager.OnSystemThemeChanged, raised when Windows changes its system theme (for example switching light/dark mode or applying a desktop theme). PowerToys Run's window fails while it re-applies theme resources, which triggers the 'PowerToys Run ran into an issue' dialog. Past tickets with the identical stack trace were closed as duplicates of the tracking issue #37859, so there is no fix or workaround in them. You can close the error dialog and continue; PowerToys Run should keep working, and if it stops responding, restart PowerToys. Follow #37859 for updates and add any new details there."
